    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectApproached? THEN\n\t\t\tDO TakeObject\n\tELSE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectHeavy? THEN\n\t\t\tDO CheckObjectWeight\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO PutObjectInBox\n\t\tDO SpecificTask\n\tEND\n"
